  "native_identity_rule": "Fixture explicitly preloads all six Script resources and asserts each ResourceLoader.get_cached_ref(fixedprivatepath) returns that exact Script object before/after controls. Self-class comparisons use this object identity. No path-string equality, injected accepted flag, validation receipt, new native/world cache, load/reload, callback, guard skipping or global class registration is introduced.",
