  "api_qualification": "Official API returns current cached Resource reference or invalid when absent. This is only TEST Script identity resolution equivalent to already-preloaded self Script operands; missing/replaced reference fails explicit fixture checks and compact-branch/sourcefactory assertions. No performance cache or native-proof reuse."
